Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Non-current assets normally have a useful life of more than one year and are intended to be used in the business for longer than one year.', 'Non-current liabilities amount to less than 56.8% of total equity in Year 2.', 'The combined total of equity and non-current liabilities exceeds non-current assets by more than 7.3% in Year 1.', 'Total equity grew by more than 24.5% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'Total assets grew by more than 10% between Year 1 and Year 2.'], ARRAY[true, true, true, false, false], ARRAY['TRUE — Evaluated against the textbook standard, this assertion is correct. Non-current assets normally have a useful life of more than one year and are intended to be used in the business for longer than one year.

