Once the overclaim or mislabel is exposed, the only consistent answer is false.', 'FALSE — On the Fuhrmann definition used in the entrance exam, the sentence is false. A business that grows its equity mostly through retained earnings is relying just as heavily on outside investors as one whose equity growth comes mainly from new share issues.

